  "solution": {
    "text": "Given mass of electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></math><br />Mass of proton <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1836</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></math><br />From de-Broglie wavelength<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi>mv</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1836</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1836</mn></math>",
